---
title: "Agent-only"
description: "Content hidden from humans but kept in the copy-for-AI plaintext."
type: static
---

Hides content from human readers while keeping it in the plaintext that AI agents receive.

## Example

The paragraph below is wrapped in `{% agent-only %}` and does not appear on the rendered page.

{% agent-only %}
This paragraph is only for AI agents. It is hidden from the rendered page but preserved in the plaintext.
{% /agent-only %}
